ass-produced Nikkes are different from us prototypes, and technically don't require sustenance of any kind. That much is true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_40","text":"However, as soon as you begin to acknowledge the fact that you don't need to eat...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_41","text":"... that's when the Mind Switch occurs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_42","text":"Mine own eyes hath witnessed it many times before. 'Tis a most excruciating sight to behold.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_43","text":"So even mass-produced Nikkes have to eat and sleep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"pinne","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_44","text":"Understood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_45","text":"When you've got time, you can focus on repairing the guard post and enhancing our equipment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_46","text":"We won't be needing any blankets to cover up with, or fire. That makes things easier.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"pinne","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_47","text":"So as long as we can scrounge up more food, then we'll be okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"pinne","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_48","text":"We can get by on that, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_49","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_50","text":"We have to do something. We can't just stay here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_51","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_52","type":"Speech","s