,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_93","text":"That's because back then there was something to look forward to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_94","text":"But now, I can't see what's waiting for me up ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_95","text":"The place that we thought would be our paradise has turned its back on us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_96","text":"Despite that, we continue to lay our lives on the line to protect it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_97","text":"How is that fair? It's enough to infuriate anyone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_06_s_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_06_s_98","text":"So, for the time being, it's no longer my top priority.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":nul